@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Admin System Management

|Admin|
start
:Open admin console;
if (Manage system settings?) then (Yes)
  :Edit configuration;
  :Persist system settings;
  :Return success;
else (Manage accounts)
  :Open account management;
  :Validate role and permissions;
  if (Permission valid?) then (Yes)
    :Update account in DB;
    :Return success;
  else (No)
    :Return permission error;
  endif
endif

if (Unexpected error?) then (Yes)
  :Return exception response;
  :Show admin error message;
endif
stop
@enduml
